  "reasons": "The supplier has a sound financial condition and has been operating for 9 years, which reduces the risk of the supplier going out of business. The liability cap of 12 months of fees is lower than the company rule of 24 months, but the supplier's long-term stability and the comprehensive security measures provided make the risk acceptable. The implementation and training periods are reasonable, and the included security measures and post-signature penetration test report add value to the deal.",
